# Local Ledger needs NO environment variables.
#
# It is a static site with no server. The optional OpenRouter API key is entered by each user in
# the app (Settings → Privacy) and kept in their own browser.
#
# Do NOT put an API key in a .env file for this project. Vite copies every VITE_* variable into
# the JavaScript bundle it builds, so a key placed here would be published to everyone who loads
# the site.
#
# This file exists so the absence is explicit rather than an oversight.
